  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 6-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "別騙自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "想想我們的遭遇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "在地下競技場和野獸廝殺，和同伴廝殺，每一場比賽留下的都是實打實的傷痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "主辦方要看到更多的鮮血和刺激，假賽，場外的陰謀詭計。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "這一切都是因為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "再看看那些卡瓦萊利亞基之外的地方吧，感染者有何處可去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "......何處可去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "我們身患礦石病，絕症，我們遲早會死，我們的死還會給周圍帶來災難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "我們是不祥的，是不可控的，是被排斥的異類。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "監正會真的會允許感染者建立正規騎士團嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "卡西米爾......不，這片大地真的還有感染者存續的空間嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "就算有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "......又與你何干呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "這傢伙，已經一動不動了啊......死了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "但願吧，我是真的不想和感染者廝殺，要是我也被感染了怎麼辦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "你去確認一下吧，如果真的死了，就讓善後小組來處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "......咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "說誰，死了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "......來啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "該死的......無胄盟！我要......打敗你們所有人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "殘害......感染者的......兇手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "......她還有力氣動？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "渾身是血，站都站不穩，何必勉強呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "來......來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "誰也別......想走......咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "......也算挺有骨氣的，給她個痛快吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "反正再這樣下去，過個幾分鐘她就要失血而死了，嘖嘖，莫妮克的手法還真嫺熟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "放心吧，你很快就會解脫——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "無胄盟的動作突然停了下來。\n腳步聲。\n厚重的腳步聲，不同於這些殺手的輕巧，彷彿背負著千斤重石的腳步聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "（模糊的對話）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "（他們......在說什麼......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "（模糊的對話）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "（......？他們為什麼......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "不......別走......站......住！我還......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "text": "......已經夠了，騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "text": "你做得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "怎麼了？怎麼突然一片漆黑！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "發生什麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "text": "哈！？怎麼街道上全都沒電了！？天啊，這要賠多少錢？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "text": "喂，那邊的騎士，來幫忙疏散觀眾啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "嘿咻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......唔啊，外面真的一片漆黑呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "格蕾納蒂他們做得也太絕了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "不過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......聯合會大樓有獨立的電源......嘖，時間不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "唔！有人來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "剛才為什麼斷電了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "text": "看外面！整座城市都——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "難、難道又是動力爐出了問題......？大隔斷？大隔斷重演了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "別慌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "啊，馬克維茨先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "......萬幸的是，今天正好是發言人會議。幾位董事此刻也都在聯合會大樓內，安然無恙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "text": "沒錯。聽從安排，疏導群眾，立刻聯繫監正會代表，首要任務是確保治安不會出問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "text": "......各個城區應該有自己的備用電源，讓各區負責人妥善處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......董事會議......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "不，當務之急是要找到機房的入口——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "青金閣下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "text": "......事情鬧得真大條啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "text": "所以我早說了嘛，對待感染者就應該當機立斷一些，不要給他們機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "text": "幸好今天董事們把我叫來了，不然各位老闆出了什麼意外可怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "text": "......事後會對這些事件進行復盤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "text": "沒問題，但是現在無胄盟的大部分兵力......以及莫妮克都被派去圍剿感染者了，現在趕回來恐怕要點時間......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "text": "......明白了。那麼在這期間，就麻煩你放下原本的任務，保證董事們的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "text": "好，但我想......總不能有人真的對董事會出手吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......圍剿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "不......他們不會有事的......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "必須趕快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "......千萬不要有事，艾沃娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "你在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "text": "遠牙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "......塑膠騎士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "你看見其他人了嗎，他們摧毀了我們的通訊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "text": "沒那麼簡單，這裡可是城市中心，能切斷我們的通訊，說明從一開始我們的通訊頻段就被截獲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "text": "電力癱瘓也不是灰毫騎士做的，她還沒來得及突擊，動力爐就先一步遭到了襲擊，現在，她已經趕去接應焰尾了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "......什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "text": "無胄盟......一直在打著什麼算盤，而且一直在嫁禍給感染者——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "text": "快找到其他人，我們的處境很危險！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "艾沃娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "高傲的感染者騎士倒在血泊之中。\n鮮血染紅了她的鎧甲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "艾沃娜！醒醒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "還、還有呼吸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "text": "瑟奇亞克，來搭把手——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "text": "......慢著，這附近......有別的人來過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "text": "無胄盟可沒有使用戰斧的刺客......就算有，這個痕跡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "text": "牆面......在滲血？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "text": "是他......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......下載完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "這就是......零號地塊的計畫書......還有無胄盟的內部資料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......這麼簡單就得手，還真是讓人不適應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "先從這個鬼地方爬出去——啊，我的尾巴——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "別愣著！快去聯繫國民院的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "還有你，你們部門不是應該負責炎刃競技場的疏散嗎？動起來啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米爾騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "我們來接發言人小姐，她還在二樓嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "（一片混亂......正好。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "（但願能順利離開......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "text": "......不會吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "（！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "text": "真有人敢趁亂混進聯合會大樓嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "（被發現了——！？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "嗚啊......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "痛痛痛......這裡是哪裡......剛才原來靠在門邊嗎，我都沒注意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "好黑啊，呃，會議室嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "得找到出去的路——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "索娜一直覺得自己在努力抗爭著什麼。\n對抗無胄盟，對抗商業聯合會，對抗關於感染者的一切不公，對抗命運。\n她其實從未懷疑過自己行為的必要性。\n只是在這個瞬間，有一股從頭到腳的寒意，令她一時有些動搖。\n這確實是她第一次動搖。\n就像盛夏時節看見一座如山的冰雕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鈴聲在響。\n回蕩在空無一人的室內。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......喂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......焰尾騎士，索娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "辛苦你做了這一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......欸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你現在，有兩個選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "此時，“青金”羅伊就在你所處的會議室門外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "交易很簡單。你手裡有兩份資訊儲存裝置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "交出無胄盟的那份，零號地塊的情報你可以帶走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這足夠你們在監正會那裡，換取合法生活的權利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我覺得你別無選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一切盡在把握，焰尾騎士。我無意針對感染者，更無意針對你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "騎士也好，商人也好，感染者也好，都目光狹隘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別與社會為敵，感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "伺服器已經被我們摧毀，你手裡的晶片即是最後的副本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "做出選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "或者，你此刻正打算砸掉這台電話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那就這麼做吧，如果你覺得，這就是你反抗命運的答案的話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......哇，他是不是猜到了？真厲害欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "那麼，現在，青金就在門外，我該怎麼辦呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......這裡是幾樓來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "這——是不是——有點高！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "索娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "小灰！接住我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "——你又在做什麼？那麼高——哇——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "疼疼疼......還好用法術緩衝了一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "幹、幹嘛這麼看著我？好啦，我以後不亂來了......放開我的尾巴好嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "......不，只是......你沒事，太好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "我們還沒來得及突襲動力爐，就被人捷足先登了，有人在利用我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "......沒關係，至少我們要的東西拿到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "這就是......這一個小小的資料晶片......就能決定我們的去向？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "現在只能祈禱它能了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "text": "......唔啊，這得有十幾米吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "text": "還挺活蹦亂跳的啊，感染者，沒吃夠苦頭嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "......！你那裝扮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "text": "你認得我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "無胄盟的高層對於普通騎士而言一直是個謎......但是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "“青金”羅伊，這十多年來唯一一個沒有更替過的青金殺手，你出現的傳言逸聞多了，那大家就都認識你啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "text": "真的？哈哈，出名是很高興啦，不過作為一個殺手太有名氣，也不是好事，畢竟無胄盟和騎士不一樣，名氣可不能變現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "text": "交出晶片，活著離開。還是我殺了你們之後，再拿走晶片？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "text": "我個人是不太喜歡沒錢的廝殺就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "......索娜，你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "嘿咻，沒事，但這可是一場苦戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "text": "活下來就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "text": "嘿，我們有多久沒有真正並肩作戰了？和鉗獸戰鬥的時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "text": "......再怎麼講，也別把我和鉗獸相提並論啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "text": "還好準備了備用燈......沒想到真會有派上用場的一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "text": "怎麼了？又來一次大隔斷不成？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "text": "外面真的都停電了！喂，開什麼玩笑，這可是特錦賽期間！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "text": "電力很快就會恢復的......但是，究竟是誰，能讓這座不夜城失去光輝......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "text": "......荒唐。真是荒唐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
